1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,564
Welcome to media E R P.

2
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:10,384
This short guide shows the team leader
workflow, step by step.

3
00:00:11,005 --> 00:00:14,809
Sign in with your work email and password.

4
00:00:15,426 --> 00:00:19,172
The Overview shows your team's work at a
glance.

5
00:00:19,753 --> 00:00:22,865
Leader Desk is where you run your team.

6
00:00:22,905 --> 00:00:24,914
It has three tabs.

7
00:00:24,954 --> 00:00:28,530
Pending Reviews, Assign Work, and Reedit.

8
00:00:29,141 --> 00:00:33,075
Pending Reviews holds work your team has
submitted.

9
00:00:33,115 --> 00:00:35,187
Open one to check it.

10
00:00:35,807 --> 00:00:41,139
You see the brief, the time taken, the files,
and the note your member wrote.

11
00:00:41,711 --> 00:00:44,395
If the work is good, press Approve.

12
00:00:44,435 --> 00:00:49,690
You can also route it to the next team, and it
lands in their Leader Desk.

13
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:54,407
If it needs changes, press Reedit and write
the reason.

14
00:00:54,447 --> 00:00:57,884
Be clear, the member sees exactly this.

15
00:00:58,510 --> 00:01:02,016
Assign Work holds new, unassigned tasks.

16
00:01:02,056 --> 00:01:04,440
Pick a member and assign it.

17
00:01:05,062 --> 00:01:07,897
You can also take a task yourself.

18
00:01:07,937 --> 00:01:11,258
Just choose your own name and assign.

19
00:01:11,885 --> 00:01:12,902
Done.

20
00:01:12,942 --> 00:01:16,878
The task leaves the queue, because it is now
assigned.

21
00:01:17,533 --> 00:01:23,941
Your own task now appears in Projects, in the
Pending column, just like any member.

22
00:01:24,511 --> 00:01:26,906
Open it and press Start.

23
00:01:26,946 --> 00:01:31,136
Your timer runs, exactly the same as your
team's.

24
00:01:31,757 --> 00:01:35,147
When you finish, you submit it for review too.

25
00:01:35,187 --> 00:01:38,243
Leaders track their work the same way.

26
00:01:38,862 --> 00:01:44,368
The Reedit tab shows work sent back for
changes, so nothing gets forgotten.

27
00:01:44,957 --> 00:01:49,884
Projects shows every task in your team, with
each member's timer.

28
00:01:50,462 --> 00:01:53,354
Open any task and check History.

29
00:01:53,394 --> 00:01:56,231
It shows who did what, and when.

30
00:01:56,844 --> 00:02:03,021
Team Flow shows the journey across teams,
including every approval and every reedit.

31
00:02:03,589 --> 00:02:06,528
Media Schedule is your team's plan.

32
00:02:06,568 --> 00:02:09,670
Shoots, filming days, and reviews.

33
00:02:10,297 --> 00:02:16,208
Each entry has a date and an owner, so the
whole team knows what is coming.

34
00:02:16,772 --> 00:02:19,560
Chat has a group for every team.

35
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:22,795
Use it to share updates and files.

36
00:02:23,436 --> 00:02:27,636
Every evening, a daily report is posted
automatically.

37
00:02:27,676 --> 00:02:30,859
Approved, submitted, and time tracked.

38
00:02:31,473 --> 00:02:33,798
Teams lists your members.

39
00:02:33,838 --> 00:02:37,739
Open a member to see their tasks and their
time.

40
00:02:38,377 --> 00:02:40,818
The bell shows notifications.

41
00:02:40,858 --> 00:02:44,411
Important updates also go to your email.

42
00:02:45,038 --> 00:02:47,618
That is the team leader workflow.

43
00:02:47,658 --> 00:02:50,870
Review, approve, assign, and track.

44
00:02:50,910 --> 00:02:52,230
Thank you.
